<osis xmlns="http://www.bibletechnologies.net/2003/OSIS/namespace" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.bibletechnologies.net/2003/OSIS/namespace http://www.bibletechnologies.net/osisCore.2.1.1.xsd">
  <osisText osisIDWork="Sloane237_REV_Hebrew_Commented" osisRefWork="bible" xml:lang="he">
    <header>
      <work osisWork="Sloane237_REV_Hebrew_Commented">
        <title>Revelation (British Library, Sloane MS 237)</title>
        <date event="original" type="Gregorian">between 1500 and 1699</date>
        <description>Hebrew transcription and English translation of the Revelation passages in British Library, Sloane MS 237, a fully pointed Hebrew manuscript, transcribed and translated by Nehemia Gordon.</description>
        <description type="x-contents">A Hebrew translation of the Revelation of John occupying four paper folios, 1r–4v. This edition covers Revelation 1:1–2:13.</description>
        <description type="x-script">Square Hebrew script, fully vocalised, ruled and written ten lines to the page.</description>
        <description type="x-provenance">From the collection of Sir Hans Sloane (1660–1753), baronet, physician and collector. Part of the Sloane bequest, incorporated into the newly founded British Museum in 1753 and held by the British Library since 1973.</description>
        <description type="x-editorial">The editor's notes record pointing absent from the manuscript — a missing sheva, shin- and sin-dots, and a cholam — together with one extraneous kamatz that the manuscript does carry. The manuscript numbers its own verses with Hebrew letters, which disagree with the printed numbering at Revelation 1:9, 1:15, 1:16, 1:17 and 2:8.</description>
        <publisher>Nehemia Gordon</publisher>
        <type type="x-manuscript">Manuscript</type>
        <identifier type="OSIS">Sloane237_REV_Hebrew_Commented</identifier>
        <identifier type="x-shelfmark">British Library, Sloane MS 237</identifier>
        <identifier type="URI">https://www.nehemiaswall.com/sloane-273</identifier>
        <source>Shelfmark, extent, script, date and provenance from the British Library Archives and Manuscripts catalogue record for Sloane MS 237.</source>
        <source>Text, translation and annotation from Nehemia Gordon, 'A Hebrew Manuscript of the Book of Revelation' (2017), nehemiaswall.com.</source>
        <language>he</language>
        <coverage>Revelation 1:1–2:13</coverage>
